# ingame.opts in Swedish (v0.9): lang/sv.ini's pack set in Settings (slot 0, its
# id 0x564E), so every string the scenario shows is Swedish, at its width.
#! settings 0=22094
#! sd-file /torii/lang/sv.lng 0 dist/lang/sv.lng
# The in-game menu (v0.8's overlay, docs/design/v0.8/ingame-menu.md) over
# Hello.gba, BOOT WITH ADDON with Save states on, in the dark theme: the game
# dimmed and frozen under the panel, the game's name, Resume picked, Load
# state greyed (no state saved yet) and the Cheats row (Hello's cheat file
# picks one). DOWN slides the pill past Load state to Cheats (every frame
# hashed); B gives the game back.
#! settings 2=1
-w "nav: home ready"
-P "@8:nav_test_path:/Hello.gba" -p @8:nav_test_action:0x7E000002
-w "launch: starting the game"
-k @300:L+R+START -k @306:-
-w "screen ready: ingame"
-s @1:menu.png
-k @20:DOWN -k @24:- -k @32:DOWN -k @36:-
-H @21:@44
-s @50:cheats.png
-k @60:B -k @64:-
-s @120:back.png
